  "prefLabel": "Plc 906.02 Licensee Obligations for Posting and Advertising",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 906.02 Licensee Obligations for Posting and Advertising.\n\n(a) Each licensee shall have a copy of the licensee’s massage therapist license available for inspection upon request of a client, potential client, employer, potential employer, or inspector.\n\n(b) Each licensee shall ensure that the licensee’s license number is included with the licensee’s name in:\n\n(1) Any display advertising, such as phone book, newspaper, or website advertising that identifies one or more specific licensees; and\n\n(2) On all business cards and pamphlets or other informational or educational material provided to clients or the public that identify one or more specific licensees.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc900.html"
